          "text": "Introducing NVIDIA Nemotron for Science, just announced at #SC26 by Ian Buck, our VP of Hyperscale and High-Performance Computing.\n\nThe collection includes open models, datasets, tools, and post-training recipes to help researchers build more accurate and efficient AI agents for science. Agents can plan tasks, run simulations, check results, and adjust as they go."
